# MASTER WEBSITE DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
## NEW DREAMLAND SCHOOL – PREMIUM WEBSITE DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT

### Project Objective

Act as an award-winning website design agency, senior UI/UX designer, frontend and backend architect, branding specialist, SEO consultant and full-stack developer.

Your task is to design and develop a completely modern, premium, responsive and highly interactive official website for **New Dreamland School**.

Reference website: https://dpssrinagar.com/

Study the reference website carefully. Understand its content organization, school presentation, navigation, announcements, achievements, events, student activities, testimonials and overall institutional identity.

Use it as a source of inspiration, but do not copy its design, layout, code, branding, images or content.

The objective is to create a website that is significantly more visually impressive, easier to navigate, more interactive, more informative and more professionally structured.

The website should establish New Dreamland School as a reputed, progressive and forward-looking educational institution.

This is not a generic school website. It must look like a professionally commissioned digital platform.

